SetupBodyRuleSatisfiedClausesTest
├── when there are no clauses
│   └── it should return false naming clause zero
├── when every clause has a threshold of zero
│   └── it should return false naming clause zero even with places filled
├── when a zero clause sits beside a positive clause
│   ├── when the positive clause meets its threshold
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── when only the zero clause's places are filled
│       └── it should return false naming the positive clause
├── when the filled count equals the threshold
│   └── it should return true
├── when the filled count is one below the threshold
│   └── it should return false naming that clause
├── when a clause's threshold exceeds its credential count
│   └── it should return false naming that clause even with every place filled
├── when several clauses miss their thresholds
│   └── it should name the first failing clause in order
├── when one credential repeats at two places
│   └── it should count both places
├── when a place lies past the last credential
│   └── it should count it for no clause
├── when a place repeats the previous place
│   └── it should revert with PolicyManager_PlacesNotStrictlyIncreasing naming the repeated place
└── when a place is below the previous place
    └── it should revert with PolicyManager_PlacesNotStrictlyIncreasing naming the lower place
